      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>O Pokémon Pato. Psyduck sofre constantemente com dores de cabeça. Quando elas ficam intensas, ele começa a usar poderes misteriosos. Se sua dor crônica atingir o auge, pode manifestar habilidades estranhas, mas parece não se lembrar do que aconteceu depois.</p><p><strong>SR:</strong> 1/2 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Nível Mínimo Encontrado:</strong> 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Grupo de Ovos:</strong> Campo, Água 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Gênero:</strong> 50% M / 50% F &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Estágio Evolutivo:</strong> 1/2</p><p><strong>Evolução:</strong> Psyduck pode evoluir para Golduck no nível 11 ou superior. Quando evolui, seus pontos de vida aumentam no dobro do seu nível.</p><h3>Moves por Nível</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Nível</th><th>Moves adquiridos</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:center'>1</td><td>Scratch, Water Sport</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>2</td><td>Tail Whip</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>3</td><td>Water Gun</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>4</td><td>Confusion</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>5</td><td>Fury Swipes</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>6</td><td>Water Pulse</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>7</td><td>Disable</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>8</td><td>Screech</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>9</td><td>Zen Headbutt</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>10</td><td>Aqua Tail</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>11</td><td>Soak</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>12</td><td>Psych Up</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>13</td><td>Amnesia</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>14</td><td>Hydro Pump</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>15</td><td>Wonder Room</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>TMs</h3><p>Aerial Ace, Amnesia, Aqua Tail, Attract, Blizzard, Body Slam, Brick Break, Brine, Calm Mind, Chilling Water, Confide, Confuse Ray, Dig, Dive, Double Team, Double-Edge, Encore, Endeavor, Endure, Facade, Fling, Flip Turn, Focus Punch, Frustration, Hail, Haze, Helping Hand, Hidden Power, Hydro Pump, Ice Beam, Ice Punch, Icy Wind, Iron Tail, Knock Off, Light Screen, Liquidation, Low Kick, Low Sweep, Mega Kick, Mega Punch, Metronome, Mud Shot, Muddy Water, Nasty Plot, Pay Day, Protect, Psybeam, Psych Up, Psychic, Psychic Noise, Psyshock, Rain Dance, Rest, Return, Rock Smash, Role Play, Round, Scald, Screech, Shadow Claw, Signal Beam, Skill Swap, Sleep Talk, Snore, Substitute, Surf, Swagger, Swift, Take Down, Taunt, Telekinesis, Tera Blast, Thief, Toxic, Trailblaze, Tri Attack, Vacuum Wave, Water Pulse, Waterfall, Whirlpool, Wonder Room, Worry Seed, Zen Headbutt</p><h3>Egg Moves</h3><p>Clear Smog, Confuse Ray, Cross Chop, Encore, Foresight, Future Sight, Hypnosis, Mud Bomb, Psybeam, Refresh, Secret Power, Simple Beam, Sleep Talk, Synchronoise, Yawn</p>",
